    "tools/project7_component.py produce requires exact external original/P7 APK references; consumers use bundled vendor component.",
    "tools/project7_official_baseline.py produce requires exact official640 reference; reconstruct needs only original APK and fixed entry patch.",
    "tools/project7_resource_snapshot.py requires official version manifest, external pinned source plan/check cache and scripts; builds consume bundled compressed snapshot/binding.",
    "tools/project7_catalog_extension.py maintainer-generate requires explicit external official640 literal tables/const/chouka plus original public treasure catalog; consumers use four bundled fixed files.",
    "tools/Project7ManagerRpcHook.java requires maintainer dex2jar writer libraries and pinned manager DEX; consumers use dispatch.xor-zlib and contract.",
    "runtime/project7_cg_rewards/produce.py --write requires explicit reviewed contract; normal check consumes bundled public-data.json and generated CgRewardPlan.java.",
    "runtime/project7_collection_visibility/produce.py --write requires the exact pinned public model-index audit; consumers use embedded bundled policy.json and never read analysis.",
    "tools/Project7DrawPolicyHook.java requires pinned external manager DEX and maintainer DEX writer libraries; consumers use bundled ordinary-hooks.xor-zlib and its fixed contract.",
    "tools/Project7HistoryDrawHook.java requires the pinned beginner-block manager DEX and maintainer dex2jar writer; consumers use project7_history_patch delta/contract.",
    "tools/Project7RequestEventHook.java requires pinned history-seam manager DEX and maintainer dex2jar writer; consumers use project7_request_event_patch delta/contract.",
    "tools/project7_history_catalog.py reproduces the public catalog from reviewed historical IR; normal build consumes the fixed catalog-v2.tsv/furniture-v1.tsv and never requires analysis or host tests.",
    "tools/Project7FurnitureHook.java and tools/Project7DreamHook.java require exact prior fixed manager DEX and maintainer dex2jar writer libraries; normal build consumes pinned seam delta/contract files.",
    "runtime/project7_dream_catalog/produce.py requires the exact official640 literal-table inputs via maintainer table-reading tools; normal build consumes catalog-v1.tsv/pins.json.",
    "tools/Project7DreamLifecycleHook.java requires the pinned dream manager DEX and maintainer DEX writer; normal builds consume project7_dream_lifecycle_patch fixed delta/contract.",
    "tools/Project7EventResetWeekHook.java requires the pinned lifecycle manager DEX and maintainer DEX writer libraries; normal builds use the fixed event-reset delta/contract.",
    "runtime/project7_week_reset/produce.py --write requires exact official640 reset_week_event/event_content/event_condition marshals and the literal-only maintainer parser; normal builds consume catalog-v1.tsv and never execute game modules.",
    "tools/bytecode27.py --decompile optionally requires uncompyle6 from requirements.txt; normal build and fixed-data verify/audit do not. Export includes explicit history IR contract/gzip for the maintained selector audit, without original marshal or analysis caches.",
    "tools/legacy_csb_reader.py is a bounded read-only maintainer resource inspector; original CSB inputs are explicit external assets and are not in the source export.",
    "Story mission data production uses explicit original640 tables/calculator sources plus the pinned original manager and pymongo from requirements.txt; normal original-APK build only appends bundled hash-pinned public TSV increments and needs no analysis directory or bson package.",
    "tools/project7_mainline32_production.py --write requires the verified mainline32 candidate asset plus the frozen pre-promotion production-base snapshots and original640 chapter/mission marshals; normal builds consume only the promoted hash-pinned catalog-v1.tsv/economy-extra.tsv/promotion-v1.json and need no analysis directory."
